{
  "id": "grammar-1",
  "world": "grammar-castle",
  "order": 1,
  "type": "grammar",
  "title": "be 動詞：am / is / are",
  "titleEn": "The Verb \"be\"",
  "summary": "學會用 am、is、are 說「我是…」「她很…」。",
  "minutes": 12,
  "steps": [
    {
      "kind": "concept",
      "title": "中文概念",
      "body": [
        "be 動詞有點像中文的「是」，用來介紹「某人是什麼」或「某人怎麼樣」。",
        "例如「我是學生」、「她很開心」。中文說「她很開心」時沒有「是」，但英文一定要放 be 動詞：She is happy.",
        "這一課只學一件事：主詞不同，be 動詞就要換成 am、is 或 are。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "explain",
      "title": "簡單說明",
      "body": [
        "看主詞決定用哪一個，記住這三組就夠了："
      ],
      "table": {
        "head": [
          "主詞",
          "be 動詞",
          "例子"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "I（我）",
            "am",
            "I am"
          ],
          [
            "he／she／it，或一個人、一件東西",
            "is",
            "She is、Tom is"
          ],
          [
            "you／we／they，或兩個以上",
            "are",
            "We are、Tom and Amy are"
          ]
        ]
      },
      "tip": "you 就算只指一個人，也要用 are：You are kind."
    },
    {
      "kind": "examples",
      "title": "英文例句",
      "items": [
        {
          "en": "I am a student.",
          "zh": "我是學生。",
          "highlight": "am",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-1/ex1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "She is my sister.",
          "zh": "她是我的姊姊。",
          "highlight": "is",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-1/ex2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "We are friends.",
          "zh": "我們是朋友。",
          "highlight": "are",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-1/ex3.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "It is hot today.",
          "zh": "今天很熱。",
          "highlight": "is",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-1/ex4.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "breakdown",
      "title": "句子拆解",
      "items": [
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "She",
              "label": "主詞（誰）"
            },
            {
              "text": "is",
              "label": "be 動詞"
            },
            {
              "text": "my sister.",
              "label": "說明（是什麼）"
            }
          ],
          "zh": "她 ＋ 是 ＋ 我的姊姊"
        },
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "They",
              "label": "主詞（誰）"
            },
            {
              "text": "are",
              "label": "be 動詞"
            },
            {
              "text": "happy.",
              "label": "說明（怎麼樣）"
            }
          ],
          "zh": "他們 ＋ （很）＋ 開心"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "contrast",
      "title": "正確與錯誤示範",
      "items": [
        {
          "wrong": "I is a student.",
          "right": "I am a student.",
          "why": "主詞是 I，一定要配 am。"
        },
        {
          "wrong": "They is happy.",
          "right": "They are happy.",
          "why": "They 是兩個人以上，要用 are。"
        },
        {
          "wrong": "She happy.",
          "right": "She is happy.",
          "why": "中文說「她很開心」沒有「是」，但英文不能省略 be 動詞。"
        }
      ]
    },
